# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# checking-out OS. Prevents CRLF/LF diff noise between Windows, Linux and
# macOS contributors. `text=auto` lets Git decide text vs. binary per file;
# `eol=lf` pins the normalized form.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never touch these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
